Note on third-party material

This repository reimplements the methodology described in:

    Johnson, Liu, Raza & McGuire, "A Comparison of Modeling Preprocessing
    Techniques", 2nd Order Solutions, arXiv:2302.12042 (2023).

The paper itself is not redistributed here, and neither are its figures.
`scripts/extract_paper_figure.py` will regenerate the comparison figure from
a copy of the PDF that you obtain yourself (e.g. from arXiv).
The MIT licence above covers this repository's code and text only.
